Third-party test data

The Grafana importer's golden corpus under pkg/grafana/testdata/corpus/ holds dashboards from the repositories below.
Each file lives there unmodified, except the kube-prometheus dashboards, which are re-serialized from the ConfigMapList in manifests/grafana-dashboardDefinitions.yaml.
Each source directory carries its upstream LICENSE, and SOURCES.md records the commit and files.

- rfmoz/grafana-dashboards (https://github.com/rfmoz/grafana-dashboards), Apache-2.0
- prometheus-operator/kube-prometheus (https://github.com/prometheus-operator/kube-prometheus), Apache-2.0
- grafana/clickhouse-datasource (https://github.com/grafana/clickhouse-datasource), Apache-2.0
- Altinity/clickhouse-grafana (https://github.com/Altinity/clickhouse-grafana), MIT
- dotdc/grafana-dashboards-kubernetes (https://github.com/dotdc/grafana-dashboards-kubernetes), Apache-2.0
